# Parrot Cage (Hyacinth Macaw) from the Bloodsail pirates of Stranglethorn.
# Sources: items.json (Bloodsail drops, 0.02-0.04% per kill, pfQuest); Forever
# client 1.60.1.70338.

step Bloodsail pirates
  tip Every Bloodsail pirate on the southern Stranglethorn coast can drop it, but only about once in 2,500-5,000 kills in our data. Expect a very long grind. The waypoint is the Bloodsail camp north of Booty Bay, among the Swashbucklers and Raiders.
  collect 8494 @33,77.3               -- Bloodsail camps
